{"title":"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real numbers that satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13b0487e7fd76c400ee0bea30959a304c405cf3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x+3|-|x-1|=x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />. (Note: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17efd2ac881ff3c559b2c6a49ef702285976c1fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a| = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b89f098423b2f86ff2cfcbe3b3cdc22bbc7f6c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ge 0; |a|=-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef8362e1f78725beb1de44c30360f0a10d0d3c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can break this up into cases based upon if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/943833d247c8f1999dcda4665585ff4b6ecd4fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> are positive or negative.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1916f2a0128af86072125a9e5d6b03ce52ac5e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Case 1}: x+3 &gt; 0, x - 1 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>In this case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c67f7cf70561bc8bb0d4c169d892af0a9791b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3-x+1 = x+1 \\implies x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"264\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdcda64cc05a107a4b78ced7a5a6f01ceaedbdf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Case 2}: x+3 &gt; 0, x - 1 \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>In this case we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f1fc29d794d2200c730f9f83580b97979e04ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 &lt; x \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60cd19cf307b124607c6eafa39d9e4135fe8172f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3 +(x-1) = x+1 \\implies x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"292\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d84768981a81647e00f5d93e305bd1eb827e42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Case 3}: x+3 \\leq 0, x - 1 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>There are obviously no solutions here since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20dcf64501720e8bbe2004de5781e00d47bc54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> is a contradiction.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f1277edb4da188e76305d675d4a83f8b0cdf046.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Case 4}: x+3 \\leq 0, x - 1 \\leq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"221\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>In this case we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20dcf64501720e8bbe2004de5781e00d47bc54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/3794e0264c3bf9cac9ae775e23f3bce4d9be7ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x-3+x-1 = x+1 \\implies x = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"292\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus all solutions to this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/6/5768585a4328879548b6ab50fd46ec52463dbbb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3, x= -1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa0a714ac5652aef7da18c0287df1513e279bbd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO\">1973 Canadian MO</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO\">1973 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 136/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 863/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3771/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!